{
 "id": "race_coverage",
 "version": 1,
 "built": "2026-10-20",
 "about": "How each lens can use a person's race and ethnicity. form_categories are the answers the form offers; form_mapping gives the category each lens scores for that answer, or null when the lens cannot place it (the app should say so, and refuse when the model has no unknown level). Hispanic is an origin, so \"Hispanic\" means Hispanic of any race and the other categories are non-Hispanic.",
